lead, the

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.634
Sesame Street

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.437
word of the day is trauma dump.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.438
Okay, that's two words.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:08.675
But Elmo learned all about trauma

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.709
dumps on Monday

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:10.543
after he asked

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.412
a seemingly simple question

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.848
on X, formerly known as Twitter.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.349
Elmo is just checking in.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.551
How is everybody doing?

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.688
Turns out everybody is not okay.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.690
And by everybody, I mean

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.591
seemingly everybody.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.760
Elmo was flooded with responses.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.228
One reply reads, Elmo,

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:29.896
I'm depressed and broke.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.164
Another says every morning,

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:32.565
I cannot wait to go back to sleep

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.600
every Monday.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.734
I cannot wait for Friday

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:35.101
to come

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:36.269
every single day

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.506
and every single week for life.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:40.874
Elmo heard from companies

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.575
including Oreo cookies, which wrote

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.010
ran out of milk.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.545
Do the math.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.480
Elmo heard from the Detroit Free Press

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.082
right after the Lions on Sunday

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:51.151
blew that huge game writing, quote,

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.919
We've been better, Elmo.

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:55.288
Look, times are tough out there.

00:00:55.288 --> 00:00:56.322
Every single person

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.524
is fighting their own battles

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:58.925
big and small.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:00.794
As for Elmo himself,

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.562
the Muppet followed up with this post.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.730
Wow.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.998
Elmo is glad he asked.

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:06.366
Elmo learned that it is important

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:07.901
to ask a friend how they are doing.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.804
Elmo will check in again soon. Friends.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:14.074
Elmo loves you

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:14.974
and the one and only.

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:16.843
Elmo joins us now

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:18.611
along with his friend, Samantha moulton,

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.013
executive vice president and chief

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:21.981
marketing and brand officer of Sesame

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.750
Workshop, Elmo and Samantha,

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.651
thank you

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:26.853
both for venturing

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.154
outside of Sesame Street

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:28.988
to talk to us today.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.124
Elmo, it was very thoughtful of you

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:33.193
to ask all of us how we're doing.

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:34.260
So after all

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.562
you've been through this week.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.031
Let me begin by asking you both,

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:39.165
how are you doing?

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.434
Elmo Oh, I think it's a lost.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.735
And now that's a very important thing

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:45.205
to ask people and master to.

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:47.474
What am Elmo's doing really well.

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:48.541
You know, I was glad

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.809
that he was able to talk

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:50.610
to a lot of his friends

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:53.613
about how they're feeling.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:56.049
It has certainly been a whirlwind.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.250
Over 180

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.820
million people have seen Elmo's question

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:02.322
How are you?

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:03.823
And we've been spending time

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.092
